---
import MarigoldManeLayout from "../../../../../components/MarigoldManeLayout.astro";
import { marigold } from "../../../../../marigoldMane";
---
<MarigoldManeLayout title="About — Marigold & Mane" description="About page for the fictional Marigold & Mane sample salon website." path="/templates/luna/salon/about">
  <section class="mm-section mm-hero"><div class="mm-container mm-split"><div><p class="mm-sample">{marigold.badge}</p><p class="mm-eyebrow">About</p><h1>A small salon built around softer maintenance.</h1><p class="mm-lede">Marigold & Mane is a fictional owner-led salon sample. The story is intentionally realistic: focused services, clear appointment planning, and a calmer visit.</p></div><div class="mm-card"><h3>Sample stylist story</h3><p>The stylist behind Marigold & Mane specializes in lived-in color and cuts that still look good weeks after the appointment. New guests start with a short consultation so timing, price, and maintenance are clear before booking.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="mm-section mm-soft"><div class="mm-container mm-split"><div><h2>What the site communicates</h2><p>A polished salon website should make the visitor feel like they know the space, understand the services, and have an obvious way to request an appointment.</p></div><div class="mm-card"><h3>Salon values</h3><ul class="mm-info-list"><li>Soft, wearable color</li><li>Honest maintenance guidance</li><li>Calm one-on-one appointments</li><li>Clear pricing before the visit</li></ul></div></div></section>
</MarigoldManeLayout>
